  "applicability_scope": [
    "Level 1 statements of P03 Theorems 3.1, 3.2, and 3.3 in Results/Overview.lean, reported as complete by Peng Zhang.",
    "Theorem 3.1: the semantic rate dichotomy, Angluin characterization, and randomized exponential lower bound; the separate Results.Additional strengthening is not an audited statement.",
    "Theorem 3.2: the exponential fresh-generation upper and randomized lower bounds, with the explicit infinite-language, oracle, nontriviality, and ordinary-computability conditions.",
    "Theorem 3.3: statistical breadth separation and generation rates, with pointwise MOP and the specified oracle, sampler, and computability interfaces.",
    "The statement types and recursive project-local definitions determining their meaning, including language families, positive presentations, valid IID distributions, randomized learners, losses, rate predicates, Angluin conditions, and nontriviality.",
